WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:05,170
Rest in place for ten minutes

2
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:07,890
The next journey must be divided into five-person combat teams

3
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,290
Now form your own team

4
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:12,160
Lin Mu, we are a group of four and there is still one person missing.

5
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:15,060
Is it okay if I invite Chu Yueying?

6
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:20,190
what really

7
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:23,050
Thank you for being willing to team up with me

8
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:25,450
You're welcome, I'm just missing one.

9
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:27,220
Can your feet still walk?

10
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:29,460
It takes six hours for the antidote to take effect.

11
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,620
But walking on the snow road has reached the sixth stage of childhood

12
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:33,620
The ride is very stable and will never hinder the team’s schedule.

13
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,900
Take a break and we'll leave soon

14
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:40,380
Lin Mu has only been summoned for more than an hour.

15
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,220
Does your ghost tiger get hungry so easily?

16
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,980
Are you hungry, little bitch?

17
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:46,540
Lin Mu's superior, Chongshou, always maintains his peak combat status.

18
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:03,700
His fighting power is unfathomable

19
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:06,980
The practical experience and wilderness survival details are even more impeccable.

20
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:10,260
Those of us who are part-time students who came in through cultural courses and basic examinations

21
00:01:10,260 --> 00:01:11,940
Not on the same level as him at all
